            <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.25, textAlign: 'center' }}>记住三个问题</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 330, height: 148, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>拆分换来了什么</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>减少遗漏、隔离上下文，还是缩短独立等待？都没有就先别拆</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 148, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text></Box>
