                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>交接带了什么证据</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>结论、来源、适用时段、未解决项跟着走了吗？只有摘要会被放大</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 148, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 330, height: 148, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>协作值不值得留</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>同一任务集比正确率、漏检、误报、Token 与耗时，小心一致但错误</Text>
